  {
   "slug": "services",
   "title": "Services & vets",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Every appointment includes a nose-to-tail check. Prices are for a medium-sized dog or a cat; we will always give you an estimate before any treatment.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Everyday care</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"price-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list price-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Consultation</strong> <span class=\"price\">$55</span> <span class=\"desc\">Twenty minutes with a vet</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Annual vaccination</strong> <span class=\"price\">$72</span> <span class=\"desc\">Includes a full health check</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Microchipping</strong> <span class=\"price\">$30</span> <span class=\"desc\">Registered on the spot</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Nail trim</strong> <span class=\"price\">$12</span> <span class=\"desc\">With a nurse, no appointment needed</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Puppy &amp; kitten plan</strong> <span class=\"price\">$19 / month</span> <span class=\"desc\">Vaccines, worming, flea care and two free checks</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatment &amp; surgery</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"price-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list price-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Dental scale &amp; polish</strong> <span class=\"price\">from $280</span> <span class=\"desc\">General anaesthetic, X-rays if needed</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Cat neutering</strong> <span class=\"price\">$145</span> <span class=\"desc\">Day patient, home by tea time</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Dog neutering</strong> <span class=\"price\">from $260</span> <span class=\"desc\">Priced by weight</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Lump removal</strong> <span class=\"price\">from $310</span> <span class=\"desc\">Including lab analysis</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Overnight stay</strong> <span class=\"price\">$95</span> <span class=\"desc\">With a nurse on the ward all night</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-band\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-band\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">Meet the vets</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:vet-ana}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:vet-ana}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of Dr Ana\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:vet-ana}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr Ana</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Clinical director · Surgery</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Twelve years in practice, with a special interest in orthopaedics and three-legged dogs.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:vet-joss}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:vet-joss}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of Dr Joss\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:vet-joss}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr Joss</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Vet · Cats &amp; dentistry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A certified cat-friendly vet who will sit on the floor for as long as it takes.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:vet-ruth}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:vet-ruth}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of Dr Ruth\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:vet-ruth}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr Ruth</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Vet · Rabbits &amp; small pets</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rabbits, guinea pigs, rats and the occasional tortoise. Ruth knows them all.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Insurance</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We can claim directly from most pet insurers, so you only pay the excess. Bring your policy number to the first appointment.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "featured_media": "clinic",
   "template": "page-full",
   "menu_order": 1
  },
  {
   "slug": "adoption",
   "title": "Adoption corner",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Every animal here has been looked after by our team and is ready for a home. Visits are by appointment so they are not overwhelmed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pet-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pet-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:adopt-biscuit}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:adopt-biscuit}}\" alt=\"Biscuit the dog\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:adopt-biscuit}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Biscuit</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Male · 4 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A gentle, sandy-coloured crossbreed who walks beautifully on the lead and sleeps through the night.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pet-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pet-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:adopt-pepper}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:adopt-pepper}}\" alt=\"Pepper the cat\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:adopt-pepper}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pepper</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Female · 2 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Shy for the first day, then glued to your lap. Would suit a quiet home without other cats.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pet-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pet-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:adopt-clover}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:adopt-clover}}\" alt=\"Clover the rabbit\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:adopt-clover}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clover</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Female · 1 year</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Neutered and vaccinated. Rabbits need company, so we will help you find her a friend.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How adoption works</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fill in a short form at reception or by email.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Meet the animal, ideally twice.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We do a friendly home visit.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Take them home with a starter pack and a free check-up after two weeks.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Ask about adopting</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "featured_media": "adopt-biscuit",
   "menu_order": 2
  },
  {
   "slug": "appointments",
   "title": "Appointments",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Book online, by phone or at reception. Same-day appointments are kept free every morning for poorly pets.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon\"} --><p class=\"icon\">☀</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Routine visits</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Check-ups, vaccines and nurse clinics, usually within the week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon\"} --><p class=\"icon\">◷</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Same day</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Call at 8 am for a same-day slot if your pet is unwell.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon\"} --><p class=\"icon\">☎</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Emergencies</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Day and night on +1 (555) 017-7297. Please call before you come.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Registering a new pet</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bring any previous vaccination records and your pet's insurance details. Registration is free and takes five minutes.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "menu_order": 3
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About the clinic",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"45%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:hero-friends}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:hero-friends}}\" alt=\"A dog and a cat sitting together\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:hero-friends}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"55%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A neighbourhood clinic since 2009</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Paws &amp; Whiskers started in a converted bakery on Elm Street, and you can still see the old oven door in the nurses' room. We have grown to four vets and six nurses, but we still know most of our patients by name, and many by their favourite treat.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We are proud to be accredited as a cat-friendly clinic, and our rabbit ward has its own quiet room away from the dogs.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every animal deserves to be seen by someone who is genuinely pleased to meet them.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Dr Ana, clinical director</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Prevention is kinder and cheaper than cure.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Owners should understand every treatment and its cost.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fear-free handling is part of good medicine, not an extra.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->",
   "menu_order": 4
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Visit</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>48 Elm Street, next to the park gates. Free parking for four cars behind the clinic; a ramp leads to the front door.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Opening hours</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Monday – Friday: 8 am – 7 pm</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Saturday: 9 am – 2 pm</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sunday: emergencies only</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Call or write</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Appointments <a href=\"tel:+15550177297\">+1 (555) 017-7297</a><br>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@paws.example\">hello@paws.example</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prescriptions can be ordered by email and are ready to collect after 24 hours.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "parent": "about",
   "menu_order": 5
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "keeping-pets-calm-on-fireworks-night",
   "title": "Keeping pets calm on fireworks night",
   "date": "2026-10-24T10:00:00",
   "excerpt": "A den, a distraction and a calm owner: our nurses' plan for the noisiest nights of the year.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For many dogs and cats, fireworks season is the most frightening time of the year. The good news is that a little preparation in the week before makes a real difference.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Build a den now</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Choose a quiet corner, away from windows, and make it cosy with blankets and an old jumper that smells of you. Feed treats there for a week so it becomes a happy place, not a hiding place.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Walk dogs in daylight, before the first bangs.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Keep cats indoors from dusk and block the cat flap.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Close curtains and play music or the television.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Do not tell a frightened pet off, and do not ignore them either. Calm company is the best medicine.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Our head nurse</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When to talk to us</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If your pet trembles, hides for hours or hurts itself trying to escape, book a consultation. There are safe calming products and, for severe fear, medication that can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "dogs",
    "cats"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "anxiety",
    "seasonal"
   ],
   "featured_media": "dog-golden",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": true,
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": "Hannah",
     "email": "hannah@example.com",
     "content": "The den idea worked so well for our collie last year. Thank you!",
     "date": "2026-10-25T09:10:00"
    },
    {
     "author": "Paws & Whiskers",
     "email": "paws.&.whiskers@example.com",
     "content": "So pleased to hear it, Hannah. Give her a scratch from us.",
     "date": "2026-10-25T12:30:00"
